{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>What is Wand Mart?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wand Mart: A Totally Normal Magical Store\u2122</strong> is a co-op shop simulator with a twist of horror, roguelike elements, and a heavy dose of questionable magic.  <br>Sell artifacts, run your own magical business, dive into cursed dungeons, and try not to die on your shift.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It\u2019s capitalism. With spells. \ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udd2e</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707510/extras/PortalGif.gif?t=1749174274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Welcome to Wand Mart, new employee!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congrats, you're hired! You're now part of the most magically unstable retail chain in the multiverse.  <br>Here\u2019s what your job includes (survival not guaranteed):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> and <strong>decorate</strong> your shop with cursed furniture and suspicious lighting \ud83e\uddf1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform <strong>magical rituals</strong> and craft artifacts (no license required) \ud83d\udcdc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn spells</strong> for every situation\u2014from floating candles to putting out actual fires \ud83d\udd25</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> a procedurally generated <strong>dungeon</strong> right under the store, filled with loot and regret\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play with friends</strong>, because terror is better shared \ud83d\udc7b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow your business</strong>: expand, hire undead assistants, and handle angry magical customers\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707510/extras/CrystalGif.gif?t=1749174274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Team up and embrace magical capitalism</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running low on inventory? No problem\u2014grab a wand and head down into the abyss. \ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot of questionable origin\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unexpected dungeon dwellers with zero chill \ud83d\udc3e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle rooms, magical traps, and cursed mini-challenges \ud83e\udde9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, that one friend who keeps casting fireball in tight corridors \ud83d\udd25</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes the monsters aren\u2019t the real threat. Sometimes it\u2019s Gary with a wand.\u00a0\ud83d\ude2c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707510/extras/DungeonGif.gif?t=1749174274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Who is Wand Mart\u2122 for?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laughed your way through <strong>Lethal Company</strong> \ud83e\udd2a</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tried to play <strong>Phasmophobia</strong> but your friends ruined the vibe \ud83d\ude31</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy building, casting, screaming, and pretending it\u2019s fine \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love horror best when it\u2019s mixed with comedy \ud83d\ude02\ud83d\udc80</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always wanted to run a shop over ancient evil ruins \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then yes, this is very much your game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>What\u2019s in the demo?</strong></i></h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you the opportunity to experience the bizarre world of Wand Mart\u2122 and try out the core gameplay before the full release.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo, you can:</p>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build and decorate</strong> your very first cursed store \ud83e\uddf1</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Serve magical customers</strong> with highly questionable requests \ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform <strong>basic rituals</strong> and cast <strong>starter spells</strong> \ud83d\udd2e</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the dungeon beneath the store</strong> for the first time (bring a wand\u2014and maybe a friend) \ud83d\udc63</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play solo or in online co-op</strong> with up to 4 players \ud83e\udd1d</p></li>  </ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will include much, much more:</p>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New <strong>schools of magic</strong>, a wider range of <strong>spells</strong>, and advanced <strong>rituals</strong> \ud83d\udcda</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More <strong>monsters</strong>, <strong>artifacts</strong>, and terrifying magical customers \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional <strong>biomes</strong>, <strong>dungeon types</strong>, and unique events \ud83c\udf0b</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More <strong>furniture</strong>, <strong>items</strong>, and upgrade options for your store \ud83e\ude91</p></li>  </ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is just the beginning of your (totally normal) magical retail journey.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More spells. More chaos. More Gary with a fireball. \ud83d\udd25</p><br><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707510?t=1749174274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707510?t=1749174274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707510/ca14840955f929d89ff5fb1cc8ba6171a19e31d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749174274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707510/ca14840955f929d89ff5fb1cc8ba6171a19e31d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749174274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>What is Wand Mart?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wand Mart: A Totally Normal Magical Store\u2122</strong> is a co-op shop simulator with a twist of horror, roguelike elements, and a heavy dose of questionable magic.  <br>Sell artifacts, run your own magical business, dive into cursed dungeons, and try not to die on your shift.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It\u2019s capitalism. With spells. \ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udd2e</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707510/extras/PortalGif.gif?t=1749174274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Welcome to Wand Mart, new employee!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congrats, you're hired! You're now part of the most magically unstable retail chain in the multiverse.  <br>Here\u2019s 