first time (bring a wand\u2014and maybe a friend) \ud83d\udc63</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play solo or in online co-op</strong> with up to 4 players \ud83e\udd1d</p></li>  </ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will include much, much more:</p>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New <strong>schools of magic</strong>, a wider range of <strong>spells</strong>, and advanced <strong>rituals</strong> \ud83d\udcda</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More <strong>monsters</strong>, <strong>artifacts</strong>, and terrifying magical customers \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional <strong>biomes</strong>, <strong>dungeon types</strong>, and unique events \ud83c\udf0b</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More <strong>furniture</strong>, <strong>items</strong>, and upgrade options for your store \ud83e\ude91</p></li>  </ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is just the beginning of your (totally normal) magical retail journey.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More spells. More chaos. More Gary with a fireball. \ud83d\udd25</p><br><br></p>","developers":[" Bobik Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3615800","name":"Wand Mart: A Totally Normal Magical Store\u2122"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707510/f4dcc8c677fea2e00aa321a634c7fa86988a98b4/header.jpg?t=1749174274","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146879,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146879/movie480.mp4?t=1748845723","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146879/movie_max.mp4?t=1748845723"},"name":"Trailer","thumbna